      "filename": "Appalachian State University staff and students after moving fish into the news stream channel (27836760765).jpg",
      "title": "File:Appalachian State University staff and students after moving fish into the news stream channel (27836760765).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/Appalachian_State_University_staff_and_students_after_moving_fish_into_the_news_stream_channel_%2827836760765%29.jpg",
